Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.35,0:00:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,They say it’s freedom, loud and proud\\NWhile silence echoes through the crowd\\NThoughts and prayers in bullet form\\NThis is the American uniform
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.35,0:00:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,[Chorus]\\NNo child left unarmed — that’s the plan\\NTraining kids to take a stand\\NPencil box and pepper spray\\NIn the land of the NRA
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.35,0:01:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,No child left unarmed — what a joke\\NDuck and cover when the system\'s broke\\NArmed with fear and classroom drills\\NWe raise our kids for battlefields
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.35,0:01:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,[Chorus]\\NNo child left unarmed — say it loud\\NMarching blindly with the crowd\\NBullet points in lesson plans\\NBrought to you by gun-slinging clans
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.35,0:02:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,No child left unarmed — this ain\'t peace\\NIt\'s a cycle that will never cease\\NPrayers on paper, stained in red\\NMore statistics, more kids dead
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.35,0:02:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,[Bridge – Shouted]\\N\"Arm the teachers!\" — they all cheer\\NBut won’t fund books year after year\\NHallway heroes, chalk outline fate\\NAmerica, you educate with hate
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.35,0:02:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No child left unarmed — what a shame\\NSafety’s sold out to the game\\NIf freedom’s just a smoking gun…\\NThen tell me who the hell has won?
